From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 20:20:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] editor: optionally exclude the invocation reference

Find All References currently includes the location used to invoke the action, which adds a redundant result when the caller wants only the other occurrences. Add a checked setting that filters exactly that source location while preserving the existing default.

Refs indexable-inc/index#2893.

(authored by an AI agent via Codex)

